# investigation scratch — regenerable (scripts in git history); the write-ups
# (docs/archive/investigations/*.md) stay tracked, the raw run data does not.
docs/archive/investigations/hlg-figs/
docs/archive/investigations/hlg-runs/*.log
docs/archive/investigations/hlg-runs/*.json
docs/archive/investigations/curve-runs/
